<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1422778166"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1499367239"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="First Date"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Adib Sin / Bao The Whale"/><amll:meta key="album" value="First Date"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:18.598"><div begin="00:10.023" end="02:18.598"><p begin="00:10.023" end="00:15.491" itunes:key="L1">Let’s stay this way, even though we’re changing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们保持这种状态 虽然我们都会改变</span></p><p begin="00:15.991" end="00:19.079" itunes:key="L2">What can i say, hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说什么</span></p><p begin="00:19.317" end="00:22.179" itunes:key="L3">Just another cliche<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是些陈词滥调</span></p><p begin="00:22.620" end="00:25.395" itunes:key="L4">and fuck the foreplay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去他的前戏</span></p><p begin="00:25.668" end="00:31.954" itunes:key="L5">Could we try this one more day?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否再试一次</span></p><p begin="00:42.647" end="00:46.722" itunes:key="L6">Promise me that you'll be okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答应我 你会好好的</span></p><p begin="00:47.007" end="00:52.075" itunes:key="L7">Even when I'm a mess, you won’t look away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我的模样很不堪 你也不会移开视线</span></p><p begin="00:52.382" end="00:57.398" itunes:key="L8">I’m no good at saying goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不擅长说再见</span></p><p begin="00:57.740" end="01:02.669" itunes:key="L9">I dont wanna have to lie.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想对你说谎</span></p><p begin="01:04.033" end="01:08.741" itunes:key="L10">Let’s stay this way, even though we’re changing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们保持这种状态 虽然我们都会改变</span></p><p begin="01:09.327" end="01:12.351" itunes:key="L11">What can i say, hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说什么</span></p><p begin="01:12.671" end="01:15.428" itunes:key="L12">Just another cliche<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是些陈词滥调</span></p><p begin="01:15.991" end="01:18.702" itunes:key="L13">and fuck the foreplay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去他的前戏</span></p><p begin="01:19.068" end="01:24.542" itunes:key="L14">Could we try this one more day?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否再试一次</span></p><p begin="01:25.343" end="01:27.439" itunes:key="L15">Maybe I’m mistaken<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许我错了</span></p><p begin="01:28.031" end="01:30.086" itunes:key="L16">From all of this waiting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待了这么久</span></p><p begin="01:30.451" end="01:32.350" itunes:key="L17">Give me a sign<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给我一个信号</span></p><p begin="01:33.110" end="01:35.792" itunes:key="L18">Tell me I’m on your mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 你心里有我</span></p><p begin="01:36.036" end="01:40.117" itunes:key="L19">Promise me that you'll be okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答应我 你会好好的</span></p><p begin="01:40.413" end="01:45.469" itunes:key="L20">Even when I'm a mess, you won’t look away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我的模样很不堪 你也不会移开视线</span></p><p begin="01:45.765" end="01:50.589" itunes:key="L21">I don’t know whether, it is right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道这样对不对</span></p><p begin="01:50.984" end="01:54.792" itunes:key="L22">But I'll dream of you tonight.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我今夜会梦见你</span></p><p begin="01:57.247" end="02:02.100" itunes:key="L23">Let’s stay this way, even though we’re changing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们保持这种状态 虽然我们都会改变</span></p><p begin="02:02.663" end="02:05.571" itunes:key="L24">What can i say, hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能说什么</span></p><p begin="02:05.972" end="02:08.718" itunes:key="L25">Just another cliche<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是些陈词滥调</span></p><p begin="02:09.322" end="02:12.085" itunes:key="L26">and fuck the foreplay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去他的前戏</span></p><p begin="02:12.433" end="02:18.598" itunes:key="L27">Could we try this one more day?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否再试一次</span></p></div></body></tt>